      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Test connection.",
      "translation": "测试连接。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Arguments are binary-safe by using <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/nio/ByteBuffer.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.nio\"><code>ByteBuffer</code></a> arguments. Expect <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/nio/ByteBuffer.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.nio\"><code>ByteBuffer</code></a> to be consumed by\n<a href=\"ReactiveRedisConnection.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>ReactiveRedisConnection</code></a> invocation or during execution. Any <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/nio/ByteBuffer.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.nio\"><code>ByteBuffer</code></a> used as method parameter\nshould not be altered after invocation.",
      "translation": "参数通过使用 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/nio/ByteBuffer.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.nio\"><code>ByteBuffer</code></a> 实现二进制安全。预期 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/nio/ByteBuffer.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.nio\"><code>ByteBuffer</code></a> 将在 <a href=\"ReactiveRedisConnection.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>ReactiveRedisConnection</code></a> 的调用期间或执行过程中被消费。任何用作方法参数的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/nio/ByteBuffer.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.nio\"><code>ByteBuffer</code></a> 在调用后不应被修改。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Commands can be either executed by passing plain arguments like <code>key</code>, <code>value</code> or wrapped inside a\ncommand stream. Streaming command execution accepts <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.reactive-streams.org/reactive-streams-1.0.4-javadoc/org/reactivestreams/Publisher.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.reactivestreams\"><code>Publisher</code></a> of a particular\n<a href=\"ReactiveRedisConnection.Command.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>ReactiveRedisConnection.Command</code></a>. Commands are executed at the time their emission.",
      "translation": "命令可以通过传递普通参数（如 <code>key</code>、<code>value</code>）来执行，也可以封装在命令流中。流式命令执行接受特定类型的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.reactive-streams.org/reactive-streams-1.0.4-javadoc/org/reactivestreams/Publisher.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.reactivestreams\"><code>Publisher</code></a>，该类型对应于\n<a href=\"ReactiveRedisConnection.Command.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>ReactiveRedisConnection.Command</code></a>。命令将在其发出时执行。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a href=\"ReactiveRedisConnection.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>ReactiveRedisConnection</code></a> is typically implemented by a stateful object that requires to be <a href=\"#close()\"><code>closed</code></a> once it is no longer required.",
      "translation": "<a href=\"ReactiveRedisConnection.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>ReactiveRedisConnection</code></a> 通常由一个有状态的对象实现，该对象在不再需要时必须被 <a href=\"#close()\"><code>closed</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
