    {
      "source": "<a href=\"ReactiveRedisConnection.Command.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>ReactiveRedisConnection.Command</code></a> for key-bound scan operations like <code>SCAN</code>, <code>HSCAN</code>, <code>SSCAN</code> and <code>\nZSCAN</code>.",
